00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:35.622
No, sir, because I had it.

00:02:35.622 --> 00:02:37.190
I had my uniform on day night.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:39.025
Like for a uniform, big jacket,

00:02:39.025 --> 00:02:40.693
