00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:41.461
I looked up

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:42.462
report shooting

00:02:42.462 --> 00:02:44.063
because I forgot the kid's name

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:45.632
for a second, you know?

00:02:45.632 --> 00:02:47.267
It wasn't the first time.

00:02:47.267 --> 00:02:48.168
How do you teach your kid?

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:50.537
Like, don't make a mistake.

00:02:50.537 --> 00:02:52.238
Don't knock on the door.

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:53.439
Don't deliver a package.

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:55.275
Don't look the way you look. What?

00:02:55.275 --> 00:02:56.676
What are you supposed to tell them?

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:57.477
You know,

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.012
we've gotten to a place

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:00.046
where you

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:01.781
shoot first and ask questions later

00:03:01.781 --> 00:03:03.616
that that's that's just a terrible place

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:12.425
